        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "Spring conditions and associated crossing activity can elevate fatalities, increasing the probability of reaching 1,000."
      },
      {
        "factor": "Search-and-rescue (SAR) capacity and policy environment",
        "direction": "down",
